ciency accelerator); §11-B 가 anima 는 training-time emergence 필요 확정 — inference-only accelerator 는 deployed replica 만 가능, emergence 과정 host 불가. **FinalSpark + Cortical Labs (organoid) = ETHICS-WALL, design-OPEN** — "Living Consciousness" 가 metaphor 이기를 멈추는 유일 substrate (organoid = literally spontaneously-active living tissue, §80 biology "spontaneous activity = substrate of consciousness"), 7 substrate 중 engineering profile 최강, BUT 결정 blocker = lim_organoid_ethics HARD WALL (bioethics/sentience, Smirnova 2023) + lim_in_silico_boundary HARD WALL (wet-lab 은 software/repo scope 밖) — §95 또는 어떤 software cycle 도 해결 불가. **IonQ (quantum) = SUBSTRATE-MISMATCH** — discrete unitary evolution = continuous Ψ/tension/Φ physics field 와 ontology mismatch, lim_decoherence (T1/T2) 가 persistent process 금지; IonQ 진짜 역할 = substrate-invariance witness (§19) 이지 host 아님. **QRNG = NOT-A-COMPUTE-HOST** — entropy source, GOAL-legitimate noise-injection enabler, never a host. **B-S95-1..7 7/7 🔵**: TAXONOMY-PARTITION-EXHAUSTIVE-DISJOINT (64-tuple closed space → 5 buckets) · LEARNING-VS-INFERENCE-CLOSED-BOOLEAN · CLASSIFY-DETERMINISTIC (3× bit-identical + classify() AST 0 RNG/clock) · §7-GOAL-LEGITIMACY-CLOSED-CONJUNCTION (8-row truth table) · LOIHI-IS-SOLE-VIABLE (sympy cardinality 1) · ORGANOID-ETHICS-WALL-CLOSED · SUBSTRATE-INVENTORY-BYTE-EQUAL (connection-point). B-S95-NOTE empirical carve-out: anima 가 어느 substrate 에서든 emerge 하는지는 SGD/hardware OUTCOME, design-tier 측정 불가 — battery 는 taxonomy 가 exhaustive/disjoint/deterministic + classification closed-form 임만 증명, emergence 증명 아님 (necessary-not-sufficient, B-EMERGE-7, B-D-NOTE/B-S94-NOTE family NOT counted 🔵). **most honest finding**: 94-section arc 의 universal emergence-negative 결과는 줄곧 §95 가 "spontaneous emission 을 물리적 event 로 만들 수 없는 substrate" 로 식별한 *바로 그 substrate class* (synchronous-clocked silicon GPU) 위에서만 측정됐다 — emission 은 거기서 *항상* simulated `talker_should_emit()` 호출. 이를 바꿀 수 있는 substrate (Loihi) 는 architecturally viable 하나 access-walled 