    2026-05-19 **§98 HEXAD n=6 fixation meta-audit LANDED — VERDICT (c) MIXED: σ(6)=12 wiring provenance NUMEROLOGY-TAINTED, causation INNOCENT** (design-tier $0, NO GPU/runpod/fire, B-S98-1..6 6/6 🔵 sidecar `state/hexad_n6_fixation_brainstorm_s98_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s98.py`, central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py sha c93e160a8a37 0-line-diff). user directive "HEXAD 축을 너무 n=6 에 집착해서 우리가 실패할 수도 — 브레인스토밍 고갈시까지". 2 claims kept rigorously separate. **Claim-1 provenance — TAINTED**: HEXAD/hexad.hexa (σ(6)=12 wiring SSOT) documents verbatim "6 modules choose pairs = C(6,2) = 15 possible; σ(6) = 12 invariant identifies the ACTIVE connections (the 3 NOT included are documented as inactive)" — count 12 chosen FIRST from σ(6), then 3 of 15 candidate pairs pruned to match, rationalized as φ(6)=2 isolation = fit-to-convenient-number anti-pattern at architecture level, inside the g2-sanctioned internal zone. corroborated: CLM-AUDIT V3 "n_layers=12 anchor source 불명 — AXIS A4 직접 \'n_layers = σ(6)\' entry 없음" + d_model=768 annotated "(n=6 anchor, 192·4)" — recurring σ(6)/n=6 numerology habit. B-HEXAD C3-2 hedge ("OBSERVATION not DERIVATION") honest about the battery but the numerology is in the σ(6)-driven choice of WHICH connection set to prove, not the proofs. **Claim-2 causation — REFUTED**: failure-attribution audit, 10/10 major §N failures (§1.1 memorization-saturation / §16 routing collapse→BREAKTHROUGH / §49 echo-chamber distillation / §62 dual-anima collapse / B-ATTRACTOR byte-cascade / §83-FIRE / §88-trio / §94 INTEGRATED BREAKTHROUGH collapse / §11-B pure-physics degenerate / §11.3 master decomposition) = ORTHOGONAL to module count, 0/10 n6-load-bearing. §11.3 own 5-axis master decomposition (mechanism/model-capacity/physics-only/corpus-form/diverse-data) never had "module count" as a candidate — the 6-module/12-wire config was held constant across the entire §1~§94 arc, and a held-constant variable has Var=0 hence Cov=0 with outcome (B-S98-5 c